[I] Configurable IDENT server that supports NAT/IP masq

[T] oidentd is a flexible RFC 1413 compliant Ident daemon for Linux and the
[T] BSDs. It allows administrators to define custom replies, lets users
[T] change or hide their replies and supports forwarding queries for NAT and
[T] IP masqueraded hosts.

[U] https://oidentd.janikrabe.com

